# Binaries and build output
bin/
/dist/
coverage.out

# `gen/` is NOT ignored. Generated code is committed — the `drift` recipe
# regenerates it and fails on a diff, which is how the proto and the code stay
# in step, and a consumer of this module gets the generated packages without
# needing buf. Ignoring it made `git diff -- gen` compare nothing, so the gate
# passed on every run while checking nothing, and a fresh clone could not build
# at all.

